<h1>Budget Automatic Scooter: Selection Guide for Hanoi Scooter Rental</h1>
<p>A budget automatic is the honest default for Hanoi: light, cheap to rent, simple to ride and sized exactly for the city's lanes. The selection question is not whether a budget automatic works here, because it does, but which budget machine and which rental shape fit your stay. This guide walks the criteria.</p>
<p>We cover the verified budget fleet, the selection criteria that matter, the fit questions to ask before paying, pricing and period arithmetic. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-scooter-rental/">Hanoi scooter rental</a> hub, budget with the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> guide, and read the <a href="/monthly-motorbike-rental-hanoi/">monthly motorbike rental in Hanoi</a> guide for long stays. The <a href="/hanoi-scooter-rental/honda-click-vs-yamaha-mio-hanoi/">Click versus Mio comparison</a> covers the two most popular budget automatics in detail.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">What a budget automatic is in Hanoi</a></li>
